 <section class="card account-role-select"><div class="account-section-head"><div><small>${esc(lang3('01 · RUOLO ACCOUNT','01 · ACCOUNT ROLE','01 · RWOL TAL-KONT'))}</small><h2>${esc(lang3('Chi sta usando MDM?','Who is using MDM?','Min qed juża MDM?'))}</h2></div><span>🧭</span></div><div class="account-role-grid">${roleCards}</div><p class="driving-twin-disclaimer">${esc(lang3('Il ruolo selezionato serve solo al flusso UI locale. Se il server verifica school_admin ACTIVE, MDM apre automaticamente la console scuola senza trasformare il ruolo locale in un permesso.','The selected role only drives the local UI flow. If the server verifies ACTIVE school_admin, MDM automatically opens the school console without turning the local role into a permission.','Ir-rwol magħżul imexxi biss l-UI lokali. Is-server jiddeċiedi l-permessi bil-Supabase UID u memberships ACTIVE.'))}</p></section>
